---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import ProjectCard from '../components/ProjectCard.astro';
import Contact from '../components/Contact.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import Avatar from '../assets/avatar.jpg';
import { projects, profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<Page>
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="hero-kicker"><span class="status-dot"></span> SOFTWARE DEVELOPER <span class="kicker-divider">/</span> INDONESIA</div>
      <p class="hello">Hi, I’m Rizky <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">I build tools<br />that make<br />work <em>flow.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-description">Developer tools, thoughtful interfaces, and experiments in AI. I turn curiosity into software you can use.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="#work">Explore my work <Icon name="down" size={18} /></a><a class="text-link" href="/about/">A little about me <Icon name="right" size={18} /></a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art">
      <div class="art-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div><span class="art-coordinate top" aria-hidden="true">IDEAS → ITERATIONS → TOOLS</span>
      <div class="orbit orbit-one" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="floating-tag tag-one" aria-hidden="true"><span></span> a little curiosity</div>
      <div class="workbench" aria-hidden="true"><div class="workbench-bar"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>~/morizkay</span><Icon name="code" size={16} /></div><div class="workbench-code"><span class="code-comment">// keep making things</span><div><span class="code-keyword">const</span> work = {'{'}</div><div class="code-indent">curiosity: <span class="code-value">'always'</span>,</div><div class="code-indent">details: <span class="code-value">'matter'</span>,</div><div class="code-indent">ideas: <span class="code-value">'worth trying'</span></div><div>{'}'};</div><div class="code-final">build<span>(</span>work<span>);</span><span class="code-cursor"></span></div></div><div class="workbench-bottom"><span class="status-dot"></span> a work in progress, in the best way.</div></div>
      <div class="floating-tag tag-two" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="code" size={16} /> a lot of making</div>
      <div class="identity-chip"><Image src={Avatar} alt="Rizky’s public profile avatar" width={48} height={48} loading="eager" /><div><strong>{profile.name}</strong><span>@{profile.handle} <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> {profile.location}</span></div><span class="identity-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="context-strip"><span>Currently at <strong>Tictag</strong></span><span>Maintaining <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@efektif/ui">Efektif <Icon name="arrow" size={14} /></a></span><span>Building across <strong>web, desktop &amp; developer tools</strong></span></div>
  <section id="work" class="work-section" aria-labelledby="work-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 / SELECTED WORK</span><h2 id="work-title">From an idea<br />to something <em>useful.</em></h2></div><p>A few things I’ve been building.<br />Small tools. Open experiments. Real code.</p></div><div class="featured-grid">{projects.slice(0, 2).map(project => <ProjectCard project={project} featured />)}</div><div class="more-work-heading"><h3>Also on the workbench</h3><a class="text-link" href="/projects/">All projects <Icon name="right" size={18} /></a></div><div class="project-grid">{projects.slice(2).map(project => <ProjectCard project={project} />)}</div></section>
  <section class="about-preview" aria-labelledby="about-preview-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">02 / THE PERSON BEHIND THE COMMITS</span><h2 id="about-preview-title">Curious by nature.<br /><em>Builder by habit.</em></h2></div><div><p>I’m a software developer based in Palu, Indonesia. My projects connect the things I enjoy exploring: how interfaces feel, how tools fit together, and how software works on your own machine.</p><p>From reusable components to a self-hosted AI gateway, I like following an idea far enough to make it tangible.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">More about me <Icon name="right" size={18} /></a></div></section>
  <Contact />
</Page>
